<title>USA: Rollins to buy back up to 2 mln more shares.</title>
<headline>Rollins to buy back up to 2 mln more shares.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rollins Inc said on Monday that its board of directors authorized the purchase of up to two million more shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company has completed a one million share repurchase program authorized November 1995, Rollins said.</p>
<p>Purchases may be made from time to time from funds on hand. The company has about 35.4 million shares outstanding, a company spokesman said.</p>
</text>
